## Local CLI defaults (optional)
##
## This is NOT release.env.
## The file is only used to avoid passing --project-root/--config-dir every time.
##
## Recommended path (per project):
##   <flutter_project>/.uploadtool/cli.env
##
## Legacy (global) path when you prefer a single default for the whole machine:
##   ~/.uploadtool/cli.env
##
## Override the path via:
##   - flag: --cli-env-file /path/to/cli.env
##   - env : UPLOADTOOL_CLI_ENV_FILE=/path/to/cli.env
##
## Generate automatically via:
##   ./run.sh init --project-root /path/to/flutter_project --save-defaults

## If you have multiple projects, use profiles:
##   ~/.uploadtool/projects/<name>.env
## and pick the project when running:
##   ./run.sh --project <name>
##
## ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Flutter project root (where pubspec.yaml lives)
# UPLOADTOOL_CLI_PROJECT_ROOT="/path/to/flutter_project"

# Config directory (typically next to the project)
# UPLOADTOOL_CLI_CONFIG_DIR="/path/to/flutter_project/.uploadtool"

# Optional: override when fastlane/Gemfile lives outside UploadTool expectations
# UPLOADTOOL_CLI_FASTLANE_ROOT="/path/to/fastlane_root"

# Optional: fix the env.json key explicitly
# (usually better to leave unset to keep auto-detection/backward compatibility)
# UPLOADTOOL_CLI_ENV_JSON_ENV_KEY="APP_ENV"
